$ crow run password_generator.co --help
password_generator: random passwords of printable ASCII, one per line, each
holding at least one lower-case letter, one upper-case letter, one digit and
one other character of !"#$%&'()*+,-./:;<=>?@[]^_{|}~

options:
  -l, --length N          characters in each password (default 12, at least 4)
  -c, --count N           how many passwords (default 1)
  -s, --seed N            seed the generator: the same passwords every run
  -x, --exclude-similar   leave out the look-alikes I l 1 O 0 5 S 2 Z
  -h, --help              this text

$ crow run password_generator.co --length 12 --count 5 --seed 42
a6mU&;-n]MOd
JsK>7N<[b]84
08)vJmw;ZK-v
SMdS{6b(P]D0
=+AopD7']nU*

$ crow run password_generator.co -l 20 -c 3 -s 7 -x
_3Gp??3T(9!abhx;G!wk
e9|t/y6J~o8qPEh<yw@$
pW6G}jd>D|Hd+n=H:iiL

$ crow run password_generator.co -l 4 -c 4 -s 1
&z4R
N'3s
8Df,
Y5=g

$ crow run password_generator.co -l 3
password_generator: a password holds one of each of four groups: --length is 4 or more (--help lists the options)

$ crow run password_generator.co --count
password_generator: --count needs a number after it (--help lists the options)

$ crow run password_generator.co -q
password_generator: '-q' is no option (--help lists the options)

2,000 more checked (of 4, and of 8 without look-alikes): 0 lack a group or hold a look-alike
